<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 23-JUN					     .</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 23-JUN					     .</headline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Depression 09W strengthens in the Philippine Sea. The depression is near 14n/129e, moving west at 8 mph. Top winds are 30 mph. Top winds should reach 40-50 mph during the next 36 hours as the storms turns more to the northwest, threatening the eastern Philippines by late in the period. This system will also be an increasing threat to shipping east of the Philippines.  </p>
<p>There are no further statements at this time.</p>
</text>
